 "summary": "The post-PR surface is minimal and complete: `IsStarOfType` keeps its body unexposed and ships intro/elim (`isStarOfType_iff`), transport (`IsStarOfType.comp`, `isStarOfType_comp_iff`) and the converse (`IsStarOfType.isFiniteType`), while `starIndexCongrArms` carries `_none`/`_some` simp lemmas and the two `@[simp]` invariance lemmas. No compatibility aliases, no `@[expose]`, and the only promotions from `private` are the declarations `Branch.lean` genuinely consumes.",
